{"id":"torrey:cherubim","source":"torrey","name":"Cherubim","slug":"cherubim","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Form and appearance of — Eze 1:5-11,13,14.","refs":[["Ezek",1,5,1,11],["Ezek",1,13,1,13],["Ezek",1,14,1,14]]},{"text":"Animated by the Spirit of God — Eze 1:12,20.","refs":[["Ezek",1,12,1,12],["Ezek",1,20,1,20]]},{"text":"Engaged in accomplishing the purposes of God — Eze 1:15,21; 10:9-11,16,17.","refs":[["Ezek",1,15,1,15],["Ezek",1,21,1,21],["Ezek",10,9,10,11],["Ezek",10,16,10,16],["Ezek",10,17,10,17]]},{"text":"The glory of God exhibited upon — Eze 1:22,26-28; 10:4,18,20.","refs":[["Ezek",1,22,1,22],["Ezek",1,26,1,28],["Ezek",10,4,10,4],["Ezek",10,18,10,18],["Ezek",10,20,10,20]]},{"text":"Sound of their wings was as the voice of God — Eze 1:24; 10:5.","refs":[["Ezek",1,24,1,24],["Ezek",10,5,10,5]]},{"text":"Placed at the entrance of Eden — Ge 3:24.","refs":[["Gen",3,24,3,24]]},{"text":"Formed out of, and at each end of the mercy seat. — Ex 25:18-20.","refs":[["Exod",25,18,25,20]]},{"text":"Placed over the ark of the covenant. — 1Sa 4:4; 1Ki 8:6,7; 2Ch 5:7,8.","refs":[["1Sam",4,4,4,4],["1Kgs",8,6,8,6],["1Kgs",8,7,8,7],["2Chr",5,7,5,7],["2Chr",5,8,5,8]]},{"text":"God’s presence manifested between. — 2Sa 6:2; 2Ki 19:15; Ps 80:1; 99:1.","refs":[["2Sam",6,2,6,2],["2Kgs",19,15,19,15],["Ps",80,1,80,1],["Ps",99,1,99,1]]},{"text":"The oracles or answers of God delivered from between. — Ex 25:22; Nu 7:89.","refs":[["Exod",25,22,25,22],["Num",7,89,7,89]]},{"text":"Called the cherubim of glory — Heb 9:5.","refs":[["Heb",9,5,9,5]]},{"text":"Curtains of the tabernacle. — Ex 26:1,31.","refs":[["Exod",26,1,26,1],["Exod",26,31,26,31]]},{"text":"Vail of the tabernacle. — Ex 26:31.","refs":[["Exod",26,31,26,31]]},{"text":"Vail of the temple. — 2Ch 3:14.","refs":[["2Chr",3,14,3,14]]},{"text":"Doors of the temple. — 1Ki 6:32,35.","refs":[["1Kgs",6,32,6,32],["1Kgs",6,35,6,35]]},{"text":"Walls of the temple. — 2Ch 3:7.","refs":[["2Chr",3,7,3,7]]},{"text":"Bases of brazen lavers. — 1Ki 7:29,36.","refs":[["1Kgs",7,29,7,29],["1Kgs",7,36,7,36]]},{"text":"Riding on, illustrative of majesty and power of God — 2Sa 22:11; Ps 18:10.","refs":[["2Sam",22,11,22,11],["Ps",18,10,18,10]]}],"refCount":42}
